# HostelEase SMTP Email Configuration
# To enable real email delivery to students, configure your SMTP credentials below:

SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your_email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your_app_password
SMTP_FROM=HostelEase <no-reply@hostel.com>

# When SMTP_USER is left empty or as default, HostelEase automatically 
# returns the rendered HTML email and displays a simulated inbox preview modal in the UI.
